### **Financial Overview & Narrative**
**The Current Picture:**
*   **Cash on Hand:** $2.1M
*   **Net Burn Rate:** $62K/month
*   **Runway:** ~16 months (Wait, $2.1M / $62K = ~33.8 months. If your runway is calculated at 16 months, your projected future burn might be scaling up to ~$131K/month, or there are upcoming capital expenditures. I will frame the narrative around the 16-month figure you provided).
