*   **R&D Tax Credits:** If Stellar Labs is developing proprietary technology, ensure you are claiming all applicable R&D tax credits to recoup cash.
*   **Price Adjustments:** If you haven't raised prices recently, consider a slight price increase for new customers or adding premium tiers to your existing product.

